        rdfs:comment                   "Picture on embroidered canvas with wool and silk threads in shades of cream, green, yellow, blue, brown, red, pink and black in tent stitch. With a pastoral scene containing a lady and gentleman in court dress standing beneath a tree. In the foreground are sheep, lambs and cows. In the sky are banks of clouds and birds. In a walnut frame."@en , "Picture on embroidered canvas with wool and silk threads, in a wooden frame, England, 1725-1750"@en ;
